# The map widget (cp0_map_widget.h, Deck Atlas 0.1 task 2) at the narrow portrait 320x480 (profile p320: zero8's 3.5"
# 480x320 panel upright, 79x49 mm = 6.3 px/mm, so the automatic display scale is 1.5x): the page bar at the top, the
# map, an app's tab strip at the bottom; the widget's controls (zoom pair, locate, scale bar, attribution) inside its
# own rectangle, never over the bar or the strip. Synthetic tiles only (harness_map.cpp). Automatic scale (1.5x) with
# the position, markers and a track; 1x and 2x; over-zoom; 512 px tiles at 0.75x; the USB stick's archive missing.
# Golden at 320x480 only.
title p320 map
sizes 320x480
profile p320
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
mapdemo open
mapdemo scale auto
mapdemo fix 150 -80 150 2 45
mapdemo markers
mapdemo track
mapdemo wait
shot p320_map_auto
mapdemo scale 1x
mapdemo wait
shot p320_map_1x
mapdemo scale 2x
mapdemo wait
shot p320_map_2x
mapdemo scale auto
mapdemo zoom 15
mapdemo wait
shot p320_map_overzoom
mapdemo source hd
mapdemo zoom 14
mapdemo wait
shot p320_map_hd_075x
mapdemo source usb
mapdemo zoom 12
mapdemo usb out
mapdemo source usb
mapdemo wait
shot p320_map_usb_missing
mapdemo usb in
mapdemo source usb
mapdemo wait
# Task 3: an online source with the network off (its saved tiles, the amber state strip), then one that needs a key
mapdemo source online
mapdemo scale auto
mapdemo zoom 14
mapdemo offset 0 0
mapdemo wait
shot p320_map_online_offline
mapdemo source online-key
mapdemo wait
shot p320_map_online_nokey
